text.en:
The Office shall have the following powers and functions:
(a) Exercise technical and functional supervision over free assistance sections of regional offices;
(b) Provide technical assistance to regional offices in all matters relating to extension of free legal service to
indigent workers and employees;
(c) Perform primarily policy and program development and advisory functions for the Department of Labor in
the administration and enforcement of laws relating to extension of free legal assistance to indigent workers
and employers;
(d) Set standards and qualifications for FLAO officers;
(e) Perform such other functions as may be assigned by the Secretary of Labor.
